["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Acceptance\n\nEvery refusal the service answers carries a stable machine-readable code beside its reason, so two\nrefusals with the same status are distinguishable by a client:\n`{\"error\": \"<reason>\", \"code\": \"<code>\"}`.\n\nThe four pairs that answer identically today get distinct codes:\n\n- 403 `missing-action` vs `forbidden` (foreign tenant)\n- 400 `malformed-body` vs the other 400 refusals\n- 400 `malformed-reference` (empty or NUL part) vs `invalid-reference` (over 255 bytes)\n- 400 `empty-batch` vs `cross-tenant-batch`\n\nNo code or reason echoes request input. The OpenAPI document and `spec/domains/custody.yaml`\ndeclare the codes; the conformance runner distinguishes each pair from the response alone, not\nfrom what it sent. `task check` exits 0.\n\n## Source\n\nWave 2 unit S report: the runner told these pairs apart only from its own input.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":1}}","target":"ent-a522490d2b0c71fd41e49c5ed745abdc","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790534634928,"id":"ent-a522490d2b0c71fd41e49c5ed745abdc","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/refusal-codes","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790540314696}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-a522490d2b0c71fd41e49c5ed745abdc","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790540314696,"causation":"cmd-child-9037623ed51151bfab69ec8308aea0834c0303be2bbd365f2a2d901a50fcce2e","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-a522490d2b0c71fd41e49c5ed745abdc@4#0~e8c0c7a02264ed65","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-27T20:18:34Z"},"revision":4,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790534634928,"id":"ent-a522490d2b0c71fd41e4